🎬 MiniMax H3 On SimpliGen: Full Walkthrough

MiniMax H3 generates video and audio together in a single pass, so dialogue, effects, and music already match the action instead of getting dubbed on afterward. I'm running it inside SimpliGen, no node graph, no manual setup, just a straightforward interface that gets you generating fast. This covers installing the model, the VRAM requirements at every resolution tier, structured prompting for better results, and a real comparison of generation quality and speed.

